    },
    "Files turned off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已關閉互傳檔案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Files with “%@” are turned off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已關閉和「%@」互傳檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finished transfers are taken off the list. The files stay where they are, and transfers still going stay listed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已結束的傳輸會從清單中移除。檔案仍會留在原來的位置，進行中的傳輸也會保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "資料夾"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一般"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get Started": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開始設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Granted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已授權"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide Menu Bar Icon Only": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只隱藏選單列圖示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold the key as the cursor reaches the edge of the screen, going either way. Shortcuts and clicks on the menu bar map move the cursor without it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游標碰到螢幕邊緣時要按住這個鍵，往哪個方向都一樣。用快速鍵或點選單列小地圖移動游標時不必按住。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to turn on wake for network access": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "怎麼打開網路喚醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave keeps its settings in another folder here, set in its configuration file, and the login window only reads the usual one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台 Mac 的 InputWeave 依設定檔把設定放在別的資料夾，登入視窗只讀一般的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave on “%@” doesn't support relative mouse.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」的 InputWeave 版本不支援相對滑鼠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IP address": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IP 位址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Identify Screens": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "識別螢幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If this does not change within a few seconds, restart the background service.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果幾秒後仍然沒有改變，請重新啟動背景服務。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In System Settings › Privacy & Security, turn on “InputWeave Agent” in both the Accessibility list and the Input Monitoring list. This page checks every second.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「系統設定 › 隱私權與安全性」的「輔助使用」和「輸入監控」兩個清單中，都打開「InputWeave Agent」。這個頁面每秒都會重新檢查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In System Settings › Privacy & Security, turn on “InputWeave Agent” in the Device Control and Data Access list. That also grants Input Monitoring. This page checks every second.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「系統設定 › 隱私權與安全性」的「裝置控制和資料取用」清單中，打開「InputWeave Agent」，輸入監控權限也會一併取得。這個頁面每秒都會重新檢查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Input Monitoring": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "輸入監控"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "InputWeave"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave could not be uninstalled": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法解除安裝 InputWeave"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave keeps running in the background. Closing its window or menu bar icon does not stop sharing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "InputWeave 會在背景執行。關掉視窗或選單列圖示，都不會停止鍵鼠共享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave needs the Accessibility permission to control this computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要「輔助使用」權限，才能控制這台電腦。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave needs the Input Monitoring permission to detect the cursor at the screen edge.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要「輸入監控」權限，才能偵測游標碰到邊緣。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave wants to remove itself and its background service.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "InputWeave 要移除自己和背景服務。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave's Accessibility permission was turned off, so sharing stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "InputWeave 的「輔助使用」權限已被關閉，鍵鼠共享已停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave's Input Monitoring permission was turned off, so sharing stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "InputWeave 的「輸入監控」權限已被關閉，鍵鼠共享已停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave, controlled by another computer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "InputWeave，由其他電腦控制中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave, controlling another computer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "InputWeave，正在控制其他電腦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave, needs attention": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "InputWeave，需要處理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave, sharing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "InputWeave，鍵鼠共享中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave, sharing paused": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "InputWeave，鍵鼠共享已暫停"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave, this computer is offline for now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "InputWeave，這台暫時離線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install InputWeave on another computer on this network, then add it here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在同一個網路的另一台電腦安裝 InputWeave，再回到這裡新增。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install and open InputWeave on another computer on this network, and it appears here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請在同一個網路的另一台電腦安裝並開啟 InputWeave，它就會出現在這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It calls itself “%@”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台電腦自稱「%@」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It works. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "成功了。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It works. Press %@ to take back control at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "成功了。按 %@ 可以隨時切回這台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its log appears once it has started. Restart the background service, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "背景服務啟動後就會產生記錄。請重新啟動背景服務，再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jump here with %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按 %@ 跳到這台"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jump to computer N": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跳到第 N 台電腦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "None of your computers control it or share the clipboard and files with it until someone brings it back. It can bring itself back too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有電腦都不會控制它，也不會和它同步剪貼簿或互傳檔案，直到有人恢復連線。它自己也能恢復。"
