            "value": "稍後再說"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let other computers control this Mac at the login window": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "讓其他電腦在登入視窗也能控制這台 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets InputWeave send the files you drag or choose there, and save the files it receives in Downloads › InputWeave or where you drop them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "讓 InputWeave 傳送你從這些資料夾拖曳或選擇的檔案，並把收到的檔案存到「下載項目 › InputWeave」或你拖放的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets this computer's keyboard and mouse control other computers, and lets them control this one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "讓這台電腦的鍵鼠控制其他電腦，也讓其他電腦控制這台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light up the screen edge when the cursor crosses to another computer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游標跨到其他電腦時，在螢幕邊緣顯示光"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lock screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鎖定畫面"
          }
        }
