    "Locked to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已鎖定在 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Locked to this computer. Press %@ to unlock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已鎖定在這台電腦。按 %@ 解除鎖定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Locked to “%@”. Press %@ to unlock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已鎖定在「%1$@」。按 %2$@ 解除鎖定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looks at the folders again, after you changed them in System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在系統設定改過之後，重新檢查這些資料夾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS asks about each folder only once. To allow one now, turn it on for “InputWeave” in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Files & Folders.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 對每個資料夾只問一次。現在要允許，請在「系統設定 › 隱私權與安全性 › 檔案和檔案夾」中，為「InputWeave」打開它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS asks once for each folder InputWeave sends files from or saves them in. Ask now, so a transfer is not interrupted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "InputWeave 傳送或儲存檔案用到的每個資料夾，macOS 都會問一次。現在先問，傳送檔案時就不會被打斷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS asks once for each folder InputWeave uses, and for notifications. Allow them now, so nothing interrupts your first transfer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "InputWeave 用到的每個資料夾和通知，macOS 都會各問一次。現在先允許，第一次傳送檔案時就不會被打斷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
