            "value": "打開系統設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Other computers can type and click on this Mac's lock screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其他電腦可以在這台 Mac 的鎖定畫面上打字與點按。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Other computers can't type on this Mac's lock screen, so they can't at the login window either.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其他電腦無法在這台 Mac 的鎖定畫面上打字，所以在登入視窗也不行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Other computers can't type on this Mac's lock screen: InputWeave can't use the virtual keyboard it needs there, which takes a permission Apple grants. While the screen is locked, the cursor stays off this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其他電腦無法在這台 Mac 的鎖定畫面上打字：InputWeave 無法使用在那裡需要的虛擬鍵盤（要有 Apple 核准的權限）。螢幕鎖定期間，游標不會移到這台 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Other computers see this name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其他電腦會看到這個名稱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配對"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paired computers show it behind your screens in their arrangement, so each computer is easy to tell apart. Windows computers don't send theirs yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已配對的電腦會在排列中用它當這台螢幕的底圖，一眼就能認出哪台是哪台。Windows 電腦目前還不會傳送它們的桌面背景。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paired with %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已和「%@」配對"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pairing code": {
