      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "剪貼簿內容來自密碼管理器，所以沒有同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The clipboard is over 8 MB, so it was not synced. Use Send Files instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "剪貼簿內容超過 8 MB，所以沒有同步。可以改用「傳送檔案」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The code has expired. Start again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配對碼已失效，請重新開始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection to “%@” was lost, so the keyboard and mouse are back on this computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "和「%@」的連線中斷了，鍵鼠已切回這台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cursor crosses to the next computer after resting at the edge of the screen for a moment, so brushing the edge does not switch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游標在螢幕邊緣停留片刻後，才會移到旁邊那台電腦，不小心碰到邊緣不會切換。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The desktop took the keyboard and mouse back to this computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "桌面收回了鍵鼠，已切回這台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The diagnostics could not be exported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法匯出診斷資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The drag has already ended.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖曳已經結束了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file arrived damaged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "檔案在傳送途中損毀了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file changed while it was being sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "檔案在傳送時被修改了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法讀取檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file could not be saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法儲存檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The files could not be sent to %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法把檔案傳送到「%@」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The items can't be saved in this folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不能存到這個資料夾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The items could not be received.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法接收這些項目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The login window is set up by InputWeave's installer package, and this copy wasn't installed with it. Install InputWeave from the package to use this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登入視窗要由 InputWeave 的安裝檔設定，這份 InputWeave 不是用它安裝的。請用安裝檔安裝後再使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The notices are missing from this copy of InputWeave. Reinstall it to restore them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這份 InputWeave 缺少第三方授權聲明，重新安裝即可補回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The other computer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一台電腦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The other computer cannot save it under this name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "對方無法用這個名稱存檔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The other computer does not receive files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "對方不接收檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The other computer does not take this much at once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "對方一次不收這麼多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screen of “%@” locked, and input from here can't reach it, so the keyboard and mouse are back on this computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」的螢幕已鎖定，無法從這台輸入，鍵鼠已切回這台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The setting could not be changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法變更這項設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The setting could not be changed. Try again once the background service responds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法變更這項設定。等背景服務有回應後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shortcut changed but couldn't be saved. It goes back to the earlier one when the background service restarts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快速鍵已經變更，但無法儲存；背景服務重新啟動後會回到原本的設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shortcut could not be changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法變更快速鍵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transfer failed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "傳輸失敗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This combination is already used for another shortcut.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個組合已經用在另一個快速鍵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This combination is already used for “%@”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個組合已經用在「%@」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This combination needs at least one modifier key: ⌃, ⌥, ⇧ or ⌘.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個組合至少要有一個修飾鍵：⌃、⌥、⇧ 或 ⌘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This computer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台電腦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This computer cannot save it under this name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台無法用這個名稱存檔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This computer does not receive files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台電腦不接收檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This computer stops trusting it. To use it again, pair it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台電腦將不再信任它。要再次使用，請重新配對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This computer's keyboard and mouse": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台電腦的鍵鼠"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This computer's name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台電腦的名稱"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a shortcut (symbolic link) and is not sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這是捷徑（符號連結），不會傳送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is not a file or a folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這不是檔案或資料夾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This key can't be used in a shortcut.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個按鍵不能用在快速鍵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac can't be controlled at the login window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台 Mac 無法在登入視窗被控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To allow a folder later, turn it on for “InputWeave” in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Files & Folders.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "之後要允許某個資料夾時，在「系統設定 › 隱私權與安全性 › 檔案和檔案夾」中，為「InputWeave」打開它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too many files at once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同時傳來的檔案太多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transfers": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "傳輸中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Troubleshoot": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "疑難排解"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Troubleshooting": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "疑難排解"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "試試看"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On the Background Service": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟背景服務"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on InputWeave in Login Items, then come back here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請到「登入項目」開啟 InputWeave，再回到這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on the permissions above. The background service then restarts on its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請打開上方的權限，背景服務接著會自動重新啟動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uninstall": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解除安裝"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uninstall InputWeave?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要解除安裝 InputWeave 嗎？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uninstall InputWeave…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解除安裝 InputWeave…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown error.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未知的錯誤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown system": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未知的系統"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解除鎖定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlocked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已解除鎖定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Up to 1,000 items, 10,000 files or 100 GB can be sent at once. Send them in smaller batches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一次最多傳 1,000 個項目、10,000 個檔案或 100 GB。請分批傳送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updating the background service…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在更新背景服務…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Valid for %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 內有效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %1$@（%2$@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wait a moment before switching computers": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停留片刻才切換"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for %@ to accept…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待「%@」接受…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for approval in Login Items": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待在「登入項目」中允許"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for connection…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待連線…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for your answer…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待你的回答…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting to send…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待傳送…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wake": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "喚醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wake a sleeping computer when you push the cursor toward it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把游標推向睡眠中的電腦時喚醒它"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waking %@…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在喚醒「%@」…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waking…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在喚醒…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you copy on one computer can be pasted on the next one the cursor moves to. Content from password managers is never synced, and nothing over 8 MB.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在一台電腦複製的內容，游標移到下一台後就能貼上。密碼管理器的內容一律不同步，超過 8 MB 的內容也不會同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a paired computer sends files": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已配對的電腦傳來檔案時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When an app on the computer you control, such as a game, hides the pointer and keeps it in its window, mouse movements go to it as they are and the cursor stays there until the app lets go. Only Windows computers tell when this happens; for a Mac, you can set a shortcut for it below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你控制的電腦上有 App（例如遊戲）把游標藏起來並限制在它的視窗裡時，滑鼠的移動會照原樣送過去，游標也留在那台，直到 App 放開為止。只有 Windows 電腦會告知這件事；控制 Mac 時，可以在下面設定切換相對滑鼠的快速鍵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When an app on the computer you control, such as a game, hides the pointer and keeps it in its window, mouse movements go to it as they are and the cursor stays there until the app lets go. Only Windows computers tell when this happens; on a Mac, use the shortcut below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你控制的電腦上有 App（例如遊戲）把游標藏起來並限制在它的視窗裡時，滑鼠的移動會照原樣送過去，游標也留在那台，直到 App 放開為止。只有 Windows 電腦會告知這件事；控制 Mac 時請用下面的快速鍵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the cursor pushes against the edge on a sleeping computer’s side, InputWeave sends it a wake-up, at most every 30 seconds. Works only on computers with wake for network access on, usually over a wired network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游標推到睡眠中電腦那一側的螢幕邊緣時，送出網路喚醒，同一台 30 秒最多一次。只對打開網路喚醒的電腦有效，多半要接有線網路。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the icon is hidden, open InputWeave from the Applications folder to show it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隱藏圖示後，要再顯示，從「應用程式」再開啟一次 InputWeave。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While controlling another computer, press Control twice quickly, with no other key between, to come back here. Control still reaches the other computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制其他電腦時，快速按兩下 Control、中間不按其他鍵，就會切回這台。Control 照樣會送到那台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While holding %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住 %@ 時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While the cursor is on %@, mouse movement is multiplied by this. It applies only when this computer controls it, and not to relative mouse for games.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游標在「%@」上時，滑鼠移動乘上這個倍率。只在這台控制它的時候套用，遊戲用的相對滑鼠不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll need another computer on the same network. Setup takes about five minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你需要另一台在同一個網路上的電腦。設定大約需要 5 分鐘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "formatted text": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "格式化文字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "image": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "圖片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS may ask whether InputWeave can find devices on your local network. Choose Allow.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 可能會詢問 InputWeave 能不能尋找本機網路上的裝置，請選「允許」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "text": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the other computer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一台電腦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "uninstall.sh is missing from the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 中缺少 uninstall.sh。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” can't take input from here right now, so the keyboard and mouse are back on this computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」目前無法從這台輸入，鍵鼠已切回這台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” did not take the items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」沒有接收。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” let go of the mouse, so it moves as usual again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」放開了滑鼠，已恢復一般模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” paused sharing, so the keyboard and mouse are back on this computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」暫停了共享，鍵鼠已切回這台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Licensed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已授權"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trial": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "試用中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "License": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授權"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every feature works without a license, for as long as you like. A license replaces “Trial” with “Licensed” here and in About InputWeave.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有授權也能使用全部功能，沒有期限。購買授權後，這裡與「關於 InputWeave」的「試用中」會換成「已授權」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your license is already used on 5 computers, so this computer stays in trial. Every feature still works. To license this one, free a computer you no longer use in Polar’s customer portal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的授權已經用在 5 台電腦上，所以這台維持試用中，所有功能照常可用。要讓這台也取得授權，請先到 Polar 的顧客入口停用一台不再使用的電腦。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The license on this computer is no longer valid. It may have been refunded, or this computer was removed from it in Polar’s customer portal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台電腦上的授權已經失效，可能已經退款，或這台已在 Polar 的顧客入口被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "License information can’t be read right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目前無法讀取授權資訊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "US$10, paid once, for up to 5 of your computers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "US$10，一次付款，最多 5 台電腦使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manage Computers…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "管理電腦…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再試一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Buy a License…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "購買授權…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter License Key…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "輸入授權碼…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Buy a license from Polar and get a license key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Polar 購買授權，取得授權碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the key on one of your computers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在其中一台電腦輸入授權碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your paired computers pick up the license by themselves, up to 5 in all.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已配對的電腦會自動取得授權，最多 5 台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the license works": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授權怎麼運作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Payment and receipts are handled by Polar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "付款與收據由 Polar 處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Licensed to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授權給 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thank you for buying InputWeave.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "感謝你購買 InputWeave。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The license came from %@. Thank you for buying InputWeave.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授權來自「%@」。感謝你購買 InputWeave。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paired": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已配對"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Computers on this license": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用這份授權的電腦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld of %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld／%2$lld 台"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only computers paired with this one are listed. Polar’s customer portal lists all of them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這裡只列出和這台配對的電腦；全部的電腦請到 Polar 的顧客入口查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove License…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除授權…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove the license from this computer?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要從這台電腦移除授權嗎？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove License": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除授權"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This frees one of your 5 computers. Your other computers keep their license, and this one won’t pick it up from them again until you enter the key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會空出 5 台中的一個名額，其他電腦的授權不受影響。這台之後不會再從已配對的電腦自動取得授權，直到你再次輸入授權碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter License Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "輸入授權碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "License key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授權碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key is on Polar’s order page and in the email Polar sent you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授權碼在 Polar 的訂單頁面，以及 Polar 寄給你的 email 裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activating…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在啟用…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activate": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "啟用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This isn’t an InputWeave license key. Check it against the email from Polar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這不是 InputWeave 的授權碼。請和 Polar 寄來的 email 核對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This license is already used on 5 computers. Free a computer you no longer use in Polar’s customer portal, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這份授權已經用在 5 台電腦上。請先到 Polar 的顧客入口停用一台不再使用的電腦，再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This license is no longer valid. It may have been refunded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這份授權已經失效，可能已經退款。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Polar can’t be reached. Check this computer’s internet connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連不上 Polar。請檢查這台電腦的網路連線後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave couldn’t save the license. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "InputWeave 無法儲存授權，請再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free and open source under the GNU GPL, version 3 or later": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "免費開源，採用 GNU GPL 第 3 版或更新的版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave couldn’t finish removing the license on this computer. It keeps trying.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "InputWeave 還沒能在這台電腦移除授權，會繼續嘗試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Polar couldn’t be reached, so this computer’s place on the license isn’t free yet. InputWeave frees it once Polar can be reached, or you can free it in Polar’s customer portal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連不上 Polar，所以這台在授權上的名額還沒空出來。InputWeave 會在連得上 Polar 時釋放它，你也可以到 Polar 的顧客入口自己釋放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removing the license from this computer…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在從這台電腦移除授權…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputWeave couldn’t remove the license on this computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "InputWeave 無法在這台電腦移除授權。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” went offline for now. The keyboard and mouse are back on this computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」暫時離線，鍵鼠已回到這台。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
